      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a schema migration and i'm a bit stuck on the transition from 2NF to 3NF. can you walk me through the steps to get a table from 2NF to 3NF? i want to make sure i'm handling transitive dependencies correctly so we don't end up with redundant data.",
